/-! Round trip for V19_110 (2021 Theorem 19.8.22, p. 956; 2017 Theorem 19.11).

* `A`: the types of the 12 theorems of the decls list (universe `0`; the three generic lemmas
  `isProperStrongBundleCoveringSquare_fibredProduct`, `MPolyfold.isLocalScDiffeo_fibredProductMap`,
  `isProperStrongBundleCoveringSquare_of_sheets` at `0` in all their universes).
* `A_to_B_of_compatible` (proved, from the conjunct `SquareBasicConstruction.theorem_19_8_22_hyp`
  and the non-item lemma `isStrongBundleIso_altH`): under `IsCompatible`, all of `B`, with
  `Kb = bundleG`; the topologies generated by `NatOpenA`, `NatOpenEA`, `NatOpenEB` are the
  project's `natTopA`, `natTopEA`, `natTopEB`.
* `A_to_B` is not proved: `B` has no `IsCompatible`, while `A` states the metrizability of `|𝒜|`
  and `|E_A|`, the local isomorphism property of the top target map `t̂`, the isomorphism `ι̂` and
  the top multiplication only under it (the top target map is a strong bundle map only under it,
  `isStrongBundleMap_tgtSq`).
* `B_to_A` is not proved: `A` also contains the commutation of the structure maps with `m̂`, `p̂`,
  `p`, the properness of the squares at the fibred products (`isProperSquare_pbarFP`), the
  multiplication on the formulas `mulSq (toFPSq q) = …`, and three general lemmas on proper strong
  bundle covering squares; `B` does not state these, and its `Kb` is existential. -/

